    {
      "id": "p0046-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale debuted on September 15, 2015, in English only, and only for home computers. Toby had wanted to release the game on mainstream game consoles too, but the Game Maker program he used to create Undertale didn't suitably support the newest consoles at the time.",
        "raw": "Undertale debuted on September 15, 2015, in English only, and only for home\ncomputers. Toby had wanted to release the game on mainstream game\nconsoles too, but the Game Maker program he used to create Undertale didn't\nsuitably support the newest consoles at the time.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28882392,
          0.09016429,
          0.87957524,
          0.15719286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
