    {
      "id": "p0046-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In 2016, Toby teamed up with the Japanese company 8-4, Ltd. to localize his computer game into Japanese. During the localization process, 8-4 offered to perform the additional technical work needed to release Undertale on game consoles as well. The shared hope was that a console release could make Undertale accessible to a wider audience in Japan, where computer gaming was relatively niche.",
        "raw": "In 2016, Toby teamed up with the Japanese company 8-4, Ltd. to localize his\ncomputer game into Japanese. During the localization process, 8-4 offered to\nperform the additional technical work needed to release Underta/e on game\nconsoles as well. The shared hope was that a console release could make\nUndertale accessible to a wider audience in Japan, where computer gaming\nwas relatively niche.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28919918,
          0.17216429,
          0.87762798,
          0.27595
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
