    {
      "id": "p0046-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Over the next several years, Toby and 8-4 released Undertale for Japanese computers and a variety of game consoles, including the PlayStation 4, the PlayStation Vita, the Nintendo Switch, and the Xbox One. Each port included new and exclusive content, along with the option to switch the game's text between English and Japanese at any time.",
        "raw": "Over the next several years, Toby and 8-4 released Undertale for Japanese\ncomputers and a variety of game consoles, including the PlayStation 4, the\nPlayStation Vita, the Nintendo Switch, and the Xbox One. Each port included\nnew and exclusive content, along with the option to switch the game's text\nbetween English and Japanese at any time.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2901221,
          0.29092143,
          0.88165435,
          0.37682857
        ],
